# W3, a (k4) alone: nothing runs, so its arrival is a NEW with its remembered visibility (Friends, its online
# preferences), no prompt; it plays a while and goes home by the gate disc.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@60
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until frames>=1800 fail present>=2
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
log a home
